  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 1450.02 Definitions.\n\n(a) “Nationally Recognized Statistical Rating Organization (NRSRO)” means a nationally recognized statistical rating organization designated by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.\n\n(b) \"Public funds\" means moneys belonging to or in an account of any public unit.\n\n(c) \"Public unit\" means the state of New Hampshire or any county, city, town, district, school district, or other political subdivision of the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #5221 (Emergency) eff 9-6-91, EXPIRED 1-7-92; #5307, eff 1-9-92, EXPIRED 5-8-92 (Int 91-9)\n\nNew. #5465, eff 9-8-92, EXPIRED: 9-8-98\n\nNew. #6961, eff 3-25-99, EXPIRED: 3-25-07\n\nNew. #9187, eff 6-24-08, INTERIM, EXPIRED: 12-21-08\n\nNew. #9557, eff 10-3-09; ss by #10997, INTERIM, eff 12-23-15, EXPIRES: 6-20-16; ss by #11113, eff 6-1-16",
